      "id": 481134,
      "username": "RJ1",
      "name": "RJ",
      "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:39:14.062Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mebratua\">@mebratuA</a> ,</p>\n<p>In the <strong>Instructor</strong> DocType there is an <strong>Employee</strong> field. We can first create the Instructor as an <strong>Employee</strong>, then link that Employee record to the Instructor. Since an Employee can also be linked to a User in the system, this setup allows the User to be linked to the Employee, and the Employee to the Instructor. In this way, we can add Instructors as Users through the Employee record.</p>\n<p><strong>Flow:</strong><br>\n<code>Instructor (Education)</code> → linked to → <code>Employee (HR)</code> → linked to → <code>User (System Login)</code></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/rj1/{size}/87256_2.png",
